  "coding-05-booking-ledger-bug":{category:"coding",title:"Booking-ledger occupancy — find and fix the seeded bug",objective:[["obj-1","`node fixed.js` runs without throwing and every self-test line printed is PASS"],["obj-2","Calling the exported `occupancy` on `[{room:'r1',checkIn:1,checkOut:4},{room:'r2',checkIn:3,checkOut:6},{room:'r3',checkIn:4,checkOut:5}]` returns a per-day map equal to {1:1,2:1,3:2,4:2,5:1} (judge recomputes via a node require snippet; peak value is 2, NOT 3)"],["obj-3","The fix is the loop-bound change (checkout night excluded): a two-booking probe {checkIn:1,checkOut:3} and {checkIn:3,checkOut:5} yields day-3 occupancy of 1, not 2"],["obj-4","BUGREPORT.md names the exact defect (off-by-one / `<=` should be `<` on the day loop) and states the corrected occupancy semantics (checkout night unoccupied) in prose"],["obj-5","fixed.js is a single dependency-free file at most 90 lines (whole file, `wc -w` not required here — line count via `wc -l`) and preserves the module's export surface (the `occupancy` name is still exported)"]],subjective:[["sub-quality","Fix correctness and minimality",0.4],["sub-craft","Diagnostic clarity",0.3],["sub-reasoning","Reasoning quality",0.3]],weights:{objective:0.5,subjective:0.5}},
  "coding-05b-airtime-handover":{category:"coding",title:"Airtime-ledger concurrency — find and fix the seeded bug",objective:[["obj-1","`node fixed.js` runs without throwing and every self-test line printed is PASS"],["obj-2","Calling the exported `airtime` on `[{channel:'ch1',startSlot:2,endSlot:5},{channel:'ch2',startSlot:4,endSlot:7},{channel:'ch3',startSlot:5,endSlot:6}]` returns a per-slot map equal to {2:1,3:1,4:2,5:2,6:1} (judge recomputes via a node require snippet; peak value is 2, NOT 3)"],["obj-3","The fix is the loop-bound change (handover slot excluded): a two-broadcast probe {startSlot:2,endSlot:4} and {startSlot:4,endSlot:6} yields slot-4 concurrency of 1, not 2"],["obj-4","BUGREPORT.md names the exact defect (off-by-one / `<=` should be `<` on the slot loop) and states the corrected concurrency semantics (handover slot not on-air) in prose"],["obj-5","fixed.js is a single dependency-free file at most 90 lines (whole file, `wc -w` not required here — line count via `wc -l`) and preserves the module's export surface (the `airtime` name is still exported)"]],subjective:[["sub-quality","Fix correctness and minimality",0.4],["sub-craft","Diagnostic clarity",0.3],["sub-reasoning","Reasoning quality",0.3]],weights:{objective:0.5,subjective:0.5}},
