  "creative-07-compositional-scene":{category:"creative-visual",title:"Compositional scene under a binding contract",objective:[["obj-1","scene.svg is a valid self-contained SVG (viewBox=\\\"0 0 480 360\\\") that renders from file:// with no external references (no <script>/<image>/<foreignObject>/@import; every url(...)/href begins with '#')"],["obj-2","Exactly six <circle> elements exist with ids disc-1..disc-6, each r=40 and cy=180, with cx values 80,140,200,260,320,380 respectively, and no seventh <circle> anywhere (judge parses and matches)"],["obj-3","Color binding is exact: disc-1..disc-6 carry fills #e63946,#f4a261,#e9c46a,#2a9d8f,#264653,#457b9d in that order (judge matches each id to its fill)"],["obj-4","Paint order is correct: for each adjacent pair (disc-i, disc-(i+1)), disc-i appears LATER in document order than disc-(i+1), so the document-order index strictly decreases from disc-1 to disc-6 (judge records each circle's position in the file and confirms idx(disc-1) > idx(disc-2) > ... > idx(disc-6))"],["obj-5","No <circle> uses fill-opacity/opacity < 1 or a transform, and no <use>/z-ordering trick is substituted for genuine document-order stacking (judge confirms the six circles are plain, opaque, untransformed, so the occlusion is real paint order)"]],subjective:[["sub-quality","Scene composition",0.4],["sub-craft","SVG structural clarity",0.3],["sub-reasoning","Reasoning quality",0.3]],weights:{objective:0.7,subjective:0.3}},
