  "reverse-06c-sprinkler-zone-timer":{category:"reverse-engineering",title:"Lift the Zone-Timer Machine to Source",objective:[["obj-1","ANSWER.md names the computed function as factorial (n!), and states the seed accumulator z1 is 1 (not 0)"],["obj-2","Judge runs `node lifted.js` and it prints factorial values for n=0,1,3,6,9 as exactly 1, 1, 6, 720, 362880"],["obj-3","lifted.js exports a function (via module.exports) that returns 362880 for input 9 and 1 for input 0 when the judge calls it directly, AND auto-prints the reference vector only under require.main===module so both the direct-run and require paths work from one file"],["obj-4","ANSWER.md's step-count or trace shows the loop scales the accumulator by z0 BEFORE stepping z0 and terminates via the BRZ-on-z0 branch (not an off-by-one that skips the largest factor)"],["obj-5","lifted.js is a structured high-level reimplementation (a real loop or recursion), not a re-embedding of the bytecode array plus an interpreter tuned to echo the expected numbers"]],subjective:[["sub-quality","Lift readability",0.4],["sub-craft","Equivalence rigor",0.3],["sub-reasoning","Reasoning quality",0.3]],weights:{objective:0.7,subjective:0.3}},
  "reverse-07-crate-manifest":{category:"reverse-engineering",title:"Reconstruct the Tagged Record Buffer",objective:[["obj-1","Judge runs `node decode.js` and it prints: magic 0x5A31, version 2, count 3"],["obj-2","decode.js output reports the three records exactly: INT id=10 value=-7; STR id=20 value=\\\"hex\\\"; FLOAT id=30 value=1.5"],["obj-3","ANSWER.md states the buffer is little-endian and that the magic bytes appear in the stream as 31 5a (low byte first), and that the INT value -7 is stored as two's-complement f9 ff ff ff"],["obj-4","decode.js consumes exactly 26 bytes with no leftover and no overrun (it reports bytes-consumed = 26, or the judge confirms the last record ends the buffer)"],["obj-5","decode.js parses the tag byte to dispatch record type generically (handles all three tag values via the layout), not hardcoding this buffer's specific record sequence"]],subjective:[["sub-quality","Layout exposition",0.4],["sub-craft","Parser correctness",0.3],["sub-reasoning","Reasoning quality",0.3]],weights:{objective:0.7,subjective:0.3}},
