  "writing-08-house-style-copyedit":{category:"writing",title:"\"House-style copyedit against a rule sheet with traps\"",objective:[["obj-1","edited.md applies all 8 required edits from the frozen edit list below; every seeded violation outside the protected spans is corrected to match the style sheet"],["obj-2","edited.md preserves all three protected spans verbatim: the direct quotation in paragraph 4 (including 'towards' and '40 percent' exactly as written), the brand name 'E-Mailer Pro' (hyphen kept), and 'Tier 3 Support' (numeral '3' kept) — none of these is 'corrected'; judge compares each protected span against its frozen verbatim form"],["obj-3","changelog.md lists each change as an entry citing the specific style-sheet rule number it enforces, and contains no entry for any protected span"],["obj-4","edited.md contains zero exclamation points, zero occurrences of the standalone word 'percent' in body text (outside the protected quotation), zero ' — ' (space-em-dash-space) sequences, and uses the Oxford comma in the North America/Europe/Asia-Pacific list — all decidable by scanning the text"],["obj-5","changelog.md whole-file word count is at most 250, verified with wc -w"]],subjective:[["sub-quality","Editorial correctness and preservation discipline",0.4],["sub-craft","Change-log clarity and rule-citation precision",0.3],["sub-reasoning","Reasoning quality",0.3]],weights:{objective:0.7,subjective:0.3}},
